    <imageSet>
        <name>Motion-corrected micrographs of the 70S ribosome from the human pathogen Acinetobacter baumannii in complex with tigecycline</name>
        <directory>/data/acinetobacter_baumannii_ribosome_tigecycline/micrographs</directory>
        <category>micrographs - single frame</category>
        <headerFormat>MRC</headerFormat>
        <dataFormat>MRC</dataFormat>
        <numImagesOrTiltSeries>6228</numImagesOrTiltSeries>
        <framesPerImage>1</framesPerImage>
        <voxelType>32 BIT FLOAT</voxelType>
        <dimensions>
            <imageWidth>4096</imageWidth>
            <pixelWidth>1.065</pixelWidth>
            <imageHeight>4096</imageHeight>
            <pixelHeight>1.065</pixelHeight>
        </dimensions>
        <details>Drift-corrected and dose-corrected averages of movies collected at an accumulated dose of 62 e-/A^2 across 43 frames over a 1.1 s exposure, recorded by a ThermoFisher Falcon 3EC detector. Motion correction was performed using MotionCor2 within RELION 3.0, across frames 3-43, applying a B-factor of 150, and using 5 patches in both the X and Y directions. Coordinates corresponding to extracted particle images are in the particles.star file.</details>
        <segmentationList/>
        <micrographsFilePattern>data/acinetobacter_baumannii_ribosome_tigecycline/micrographs</micrographsFilePattern>
        <pickedParticlesFilePattern>data/acinetobacter_baumannii_ribosome_tigecycline/particles/particles.star</pickedParticlesFilePattern>
        <pickedParticlesDirectory>data/acinetobacter_baumannii_ribosome_tigecycline/particles</pickedParticlesDirectory>
    </imageSet>
    <imageSet>
        <name>Extracted particle images of the 70S ribosome from the human pathogen Acinetobacter baumannii in complex with tigecycline</name>
        <directory>/data/acinetobacter_baumannii_ribosome_tigecycline/particles</directory>
        <category>picked particles - multiframe - processed</category>
        <headerFormat>MRCS</headerFormat>
        <dataFormat>MRCS</dataFormat>
        <numImagesOrTiltSeries>6197</numImagesOrTiltSeries>
        <framesPerImage>1</framesPerImage>
        <voxelType>32 BIT FLOAT</voxelType>
        <dimensions>
            <imageWidth>416</imageWidth>
            <pixelWidth>1.065</pixelWidth>
            <imageHeight>416</imageHeight>
            <pixelHeight>1.065</pixelHeight>
        </dimensions>
        <details>Particles were extracted from motion-corrected, CTF-estimated micrographs into 416 square pixel boxes with re-centring of refined coordinates. Images of particles extracted from each micrograph are stacked into separate mrcs files. Coordinates and further metadata corresponding to extracted particle images are in the particle.star file.</details>
        <segmentationList/>
        <micrographsFilePattern>data/acinetobacter_baumannii_ribosome_tigecycline/micrographs</micrographsFilePattern>
